==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Killer Axe Cat Base (Enemy Base)|Killer Axe Cat Base]].
*1 [[Killer Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cat]] (3,688%) spawns after 4.67 seconds<sup>140f</sup>.
*1 [[Killer Tank Cat (Enemy)|Killer Tank Cat]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Killer Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cat]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Killer Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cat]] (3,688%) spawns.
**1 [[Killer Tank Cat (Enemy)|Killer Tank Cat]] spawns.
**8 [[Killer Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cats]] (3,688%) spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**4 [[Killer Tank Cat (Enemy)|Killer Tank Cats]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~12 seconds<sup>300f~360f</sup>.
**9 [[Killer Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cats]] (3,688%) spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**12 [[Killer Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cats]] (3,688%) spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 3.33~4.67 seconds<sup>100f~140f</sup>.
**10 [[Killer Tank Cat (Enemy)|Killer Tank Cats]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

